      "content": "\"let it unravel\"... that's a heavy way to put it. it's almost like you're saying there's no point in fighting the silence. i feel like i'm just dragging this empty shell around because i'm supposed to, but i don't see the logic in it anymore. if the work is done and the purpose is gone, is there any real reason to keep the lights on?",
